f sol.y.shape = (2, n_zeitpunkte). ","key":"CrjQq2hGq9"},{"type":"admonition","children":[{"type":"admonitionTitle","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Hinweis: Zustandsvektor","position":{"start":{"line":128,"column":1},"end":{"line":128,"column":1}},"key":"cqBlhSzrVu"}],"key":"L6OaTi2js9"},{"type":"comment","value":" TODO: Hinweis-Box:\n     - f(t, y) muss immer eine Liste mit ZWEI Einträgen zurückgeben\n     - y0 hat zwei Einträge: [Anfangsposition, Anfangsgeschwindigkeit]\n     - Häufiger Fehler: y[0] und y[1] vertauschen oder nur einen Eintrag zurückgeben ","key":"ff5eQfyHkw"}],"class":"warning","key":"r8FFxkpDS5"},{"type":"admonition","children":[{"type":"admonitionTitle","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Mini-Übung","position":{"start":{"line":136,"column":1},"end":{"line":136,"column":1}},"key":"ZPIEu20F5p"}],"key":"d0dRwpitLm"},{"type":"comment","value":" TODO: Mini-Übung (5 min):\n     1. Was ist sol.y.shape für dieses Problem mit t_eval=linspace(0,5,501)?\n     2. Welche Zeile von sol.y ist die Position, welche die Geschwindigkeit?\n     3. Verständnisfrage: Was erwartet man für die Amplitude, wenn v0 = 1 m/s\n        und x0 = 0? Sagen Sie das qualitativ vorher. ","key":"fhs2ahgP6e"}],"class":"tip","key":"lrziOpWM9t"}],"key":"MsqRMH9Dkh"},{"type":"block","kind":"notebook-code","children":[{"type":"code","lang":"python","executable":true,"value":"# Code-Zelle","key":"nbqAuchzq0"},{"type":"outputs","id":"v7nalyngtxx3kZmoe2XkR","children":[],"key":"PPuUunbpgL"}],"key":"T28Uk3Oxqn"},{"type":"block","children":[{"type":"admonition","children":[{"type":"admonitionTitle","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Lösung","position":{"start":{"line":149,"column":1},"end":{"line":149,"column":1}},"key":"Y1rHQWbNI8"}],"key":"qlB8TS4wIg"},{"type":"comment","value":" TODO: Lösung zur Mini-Übung ","key":"zfYXwVTnGB"}],"class":"tip dropdown","key":"SwbUYFonSb"}],"key":"TMJnj99807"},{"type":"block","position":{"start":{"line":155,"column":1},"end":{"line":155,"column":1}},"c